WEBVTT

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.250
A food package is ordered through a delivery app.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:10.650
The courier who takes the order has no idea there are drugs inside the box.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:17.150
That small link uncovered a cannabis delivery ring run through technology.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:25.350
It began one evening, when police stopped a courier who was acting strangely.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:31.350
He said he only took an order through an app, from a woman asking him to deliver to several places,

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:36.250
and had no idea what was inside.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:40.750
The line between legal and illegal deliveries is getting thinner.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:45.950
Police advise people, especially delivery drivers, to stay alert:

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.050
never transport packages of unknown origin, never sign for or deliver items on behalf of strangers.
